m with tears in her eyes.\n\nRIVEN:\n\"I came too late.\"\n\nA short silence.\n\nFather is becoming weaker.\n\nHe looks into Riven's eyes.\n\nFATHER:\n\"Do you remember what I told you?\"\n\nRiven answers him.\n\nRIVEN:\n\"Protect those who can't protect themselves.\"\n\nFather gives Riven a small, tired smile.\n\nFATHER:\n\"Then keep going.\"\n\nHis hand slowly slips away from Riven's face.\n\nRiven catches his hand.\n\nRIVEN:\n\"Father?\"\n\nFather does not respond.\n\nRiven watches him for a moment.\n\nShe realizes he is gone.\n\nRIVEN:\n\"Father...\"\n\nRiven remains beside him,\nquietly holding his hand.\n\nShe does not scream.\n\nHold on Riven and Father together.\n\nCUT.", "reply_message_format": "生成された動画：%s"}}}, "chat_history_count": "0", "chat_id": "1507012179473169", "chat_next": "1", "client_report_scene": "gui", "collection_id": "fd77079b-6a0f-4645-b8ef-14720c6a1068", "commerce_credit_config_enable": "0", "conversation_init_option": {"need_ack_conversation": true}, "cot_switch": "0", "group": "1790530249", "has_nested_image": "1", "image_attachment_num": "4", "inner_app_id": "495671", "inner_bot_id": "7339470689562525703", "inner_cluster": "default", "inner_did": "7688722267267384837", "inner_env": "prod", "inner_flow_app_variant": "doubao", "inner_is_dola_agent_hub": "1", "inner_is_tour": "false", "inner_libra_versions": "72202937,73582984,76233209,76915148,76999789,77046910,77046923,77068989,77069090,77088724,77102831,77110979,77111024,77111099,77111133,77111190,71795104,72061060,72168304,76461562,76709907,77202863,76295625,76961156,77019338,77088587", "inner_log_id": "20260928013049505C43EF796761727035", "inner_msg_lang_code": "en", "inner_msg_lang_confidence": "0.9978272914886475", "inner_msg_lang_display_code": "en", "inner_msg_lang_exemption": "false", "inner_pc_version": "3.38.0", "inner_platform": "web", "inner_real_app_id": "495671", "inner_region": "VN", "inner_samantha_web": "true", "inner_tea_uuid": "7688722272875546117", "inner_terminal_app_